{
  "title": "7-Eleven · Health 429 & Errors",
  "panels": [
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "wFXCXqVSk"
      },
      "description": "จำนวนครั้งที่ omise-gateway เรียก Omise/OPN API แล้วได้รับ 429 Too Many Requests กลับมา\n\nดูยังไง: ถ้าขึ้นมาหมายความว่า Omise API rate limit TMN แล้ว request ถัดไปจะ fail ต่อเนื่อง\n\nAction: แจ้ง Omise support ทันที พร้อมช่วงเวลาที่เกิดและ volume ที่ส่งไป",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 15,
            "lineWidth": 2
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green"
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 545
      },
      "id": 9036,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "wFXCXqVSk"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(http_client_requests_seconds_count{app_name=\"omise-gateway\",status=\"429\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "429 from Omise API",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "wFXCXqVSk"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (uri) (increase(http_client_requests_seconds_count{app_name=\"omise-gateway\",status=\"429\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{uri}}",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Omise API — 429 Rate Limit (outbound http_client)",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "wFXCXqVSk"
      },
      "description": "จำนวน transaction ใน omise_gateway_transaction_total ที่ status เกี่ยวกับ rate limit หรือ service unavailable\n\nดูยังไง: 429 จาก Omise อาจ map เป็น SERVICE_UNAVAILABLE หรือ OMISE_CONNECTION_ERROR ใน metric นี้\n\nถ้าเห็น spike พร้อมกับ panel ซ้าย = ยืนยันว่า 429 กระทบ transaction จริง",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 15,
            "lineWidth": 2
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 545
      },
      "id": 9037,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "wFXCXqVSk"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (status_code) (increase(omise_gateway_transaction_total{service=\"charge\",mcc=\"711\",status_code=~\"SERVICE_UNAVAILABLE|OMISE_CONNECTION_ERROR|TOO_MANY_REQUESTS|RATE_LIMIT\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{status_code}}",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "wFXCXqVSk"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (status_code) (increase(http_server_requests_seconds_count{app_name=\"omise-gateway\",status=\"429\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "omise-gw returns 429 → {{status_code}}",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Omise API — 429 Rate Limit (omise_gateway_transaction_total)",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
